OL,4,BMoore eyes Kane shirt as Spurs' past   
OL,5,Band future stars meet                  
OL,6,GCologne loanee Mikey Moore says he     
OL,7,Ghopes to exchange shirts with former   
OL,8,GTottenham team-mate Harry Kane when    
OL,9,Gthey face Bayern Munich in the         
OL,10,GBundesliga on Friday.                  
OL,12,FThe 19-year-old England Under-21       
OL,13,Finternational is on a season-long loan 
OL,14,Ffrom Spurs, while Three Lions captain  
OL,15,Fand Ballon d'Or winner Kane left north 
OL,16,FLondon to join Bundesliga giants       
OL,17,FBayern in 2023.                        
